{"code":"088910","name":"동우팜투테이블","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"식품","sector_desc":"가공식품 제조. 경기 방어적이며 원재료(곡물) 가격과 해외 판매 확대가 실적 변수입니다.","desc":"동사는 1993년 양계 및 축산물 제조와 판매업을 위해 설립되었으며, 2006년 코스닥시장에 상장됨. 농림수산식품부 지정 가축계열화 업체로 Farm to Plate System과 Cold Chain System을 도입하여 계육제품 생산 및 판매를 하는 수평계열화 업체임. 위탁사육 계약을 통해 농가의 안정된 수입과 품질 우수한 원재료 조달하며, 2026년 기준 국내 도계시장 점유율 15.2%를 확보하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-28","n_days":300,"close":1870.0,"open":1861.0,"high":1874.0,"low":1848.0,"volume":31772,"amount":59413640.0,"ret_1d":1.1357,"gap":0.649,"range_pct":1.3904,"ret_5":-1.4752,"ret_20":-5.8883,"ret_60":-7.6543,"ret_120":-24.8996,"ret_250":-12.2066,"ma20":1913.55,"ma60":2029.6,"ma120":2162.1333,"ma200":2213.08,"close_vs_ma200":-15.5024,"close_vs_ma60":-7.8636,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-47.2148,"r2_60":0.8577,"slope_120":-41.9803,"r2_120":0.8236,"slope_250":-2.733,"r2_250":0.0095,"high52":2730.0,"low52":1820.0,"pos_52w":5.4945,"dd_52w":-31.5018,"mdd_1y":-29.8286,"atr14_pct":3.9343,"vol_ann_60":20.2861,"vol_avg20":62167.65,"vol_ratio20":0.5111,"vr5":0.7335,"vr20":0.4813,"amount_avg5":67615478.4,"amount_avg20":119366962.55,"amount_avg60":92567194.65,"obv_chg20":-44.6323,"turnover_20":4.8339,"pv_eff_20":-1.2181,"rsi14":37.0915,"frgn_net_5":-25750.0,"inst_net_5":193.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.1001,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0008,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0994,"frgn_net_20":-56896.0,"inst_net_20":-24475.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.2212,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0952,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.3164,"frgn_net_60":-137451.0,"inst_net_60":37525.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.5344,"inst_net_60_pct":0.1459,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.3885,"frgn_net_120":122469.0,"inst_net_120":387546.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.4761,"inst_net_120_pct":1.5067,"smart_net_120_pct":1.9828,"foreign_ratio":5.71,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.62,"smart_buy_streak":2,"op_income_q":10.0,"op_margin_q":1.0965,"op_qoq":-76.1905,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-80.7692,"rev_yoy":6.6667,"op_trend_4q":-20.155,"fin_period":"202606","roe":13.58,"debt_ratio":15.06,"pe